{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23560","headline":"对酒吟 · 白居易","name":"对酒吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一抛学士笔，三佩使君符。\n未换银青绶，唯添雪白须。\n公门衙退掩，妓席客来铺。\n履舃从相近，讴吟任所须。\n金衔嘶五马，钿带舞双姝。\n不得当年有，犹胜到老无。\n合声歌汉月，齐手拍吴歈。\n今夜还先醉，应烦红袖扶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}